Id":"toolu_01J8b3AAZWZf1ae9sMazsxYi","toolName":"xorq_catalog_schema","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Type: Source (bound)\n\nSchema Out:\n  state_name               string\n  state_abbr               string\n  farmers_markets          int64\n  csa_programs             int64\n  farm_stands              int64\n  snap_ebt_markets         int64\n  snap_ebt_pct             float64\n  organic_vendor_markets   int64\n  organic_pct              float64\n  markets_with_website     int64\n  website_pct              float64\n"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1786914664231},{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"toolu_018gMco6koKgESVUGMG1LX1U","toolName":"xorq_catalog_schema","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Type: Source (bound)\n\nSchema Out:\n  SUMLEV                   int64\n  REGION                   string\n  DIVISION                 string\n  STATE                    int64\n  NAME                     string\n  ESTIMATESBASE2020        int64\n  POPESTIMATE2020          int64\n  POPESTIMATE2021          int64\n  POPESTIMATE2022          int64\n  POPESTIMATE2023          int64\n  POPESTIMATE2024          int64\n  POPESTIMATE2025          int64\n  NPOPCHG_2020             int64\n  NPOPCHG_2021             int64\n  NPOPCHG_2022             int64\n  NPOPCHG_2023             int64\n  NPOPCHG_2024             int64\n  NPOPCHG_2025             int64\n  BIRTHS2020               int64\n  BIRTHS2021               int64\n  BIRTHS2022               int64\n  BIRTHS2023               int64\n  BIRTHS2024               int64\n  BIRTHS2025               int64\n  DEATHS2020               int64\n  DEATHS2021               int64\n  DEATHS2022               int64\n  DEATHS2023               int64\n  DEATHS2024               int64\n  DEATHS2025               int64\n  NATURALCHG2020           int64\n  NATURALCHG2021           int64\n  NATURALCHG2022           int64\n  NATURALCHG2023           int64\n  NATURALCHG2024           int64\n  NATURALCHG2025           int64\n  INTERNATIONALMIG2020     int64